WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.730
Down the hatch-nano!

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.310
They didn't serve lunch due to closing ceremonies,

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:11.410
so Mikan's stomach was rumbling-nano.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.110
What is thee so happy about, Lala?

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.440
There's a special Christmas concert today!

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.130
It's not for the GrandPrix, which means I get to perform with Sophie-san!

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.810
As well as Shion-san!

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.490
We'll all get to perform together!

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:28.630
There's a lot going on this year due to the charm's rules,

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.590
but we still get to be together for Christmas!

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.600
Hooray!

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.910
Merry Christmas!

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.800
Merry X-mas-nano!

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.640
Besides, isn't Alomagedon going to be the final act?

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.320
It's been a while since you've performed, so I can't wait!

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:44.990
It seems thee hast finally come to understand our greatness.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:48.660
However, once Christmas is over, it'll be time for WinDrea.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.360
We shall unite and overthrow the Prodigy Team there!

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:51.550
Hooray! Hooray!

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.860
Huh? Hold on...

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:57.820
Without Shion and Sophie, SoLaMi Dressing only has four members.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.120
But adding the two of us in would result in six again.

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:05.330
Dream Theatre Concerts can only be five people...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.060
Hooray!

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:08.280
Aloma!

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.560
Stop frowning.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:12.210
Huh?

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.510
It's Christmas Eve, yet there are kids crying over there-nano.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.550
What hast happened?

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.220
What's wrong?

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.340
Aloma-oneechan...

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:27.980
Mikan-oneechan and Lala-oneechan...

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:30.980
If it isn't Anko and Miruku!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.980
Happy Bye-bye Christmas-nano!

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:09.860
Anko-chan and Miruku-chan!

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.610
Is Kero doing well?

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:12.500
Yeah.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.580
What are you crying about-nano?

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.460
Feel free to tell us.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:22.680
You see... Anko is moving far away tomorrow.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.850
Eh?!

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:28.490
So she has to say bye-bye to her good friend-nano.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:32.800
I don't want to have to say bye-bye to Anko-chan!

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.130
Don't worry-nano.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.820
The two of you are really close,

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:44.320
so you're definitely connected
by an invisible thread of fate-nano.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.590
Invisible?

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:47.580
Thread of fate?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.450
Yeah!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:56.220
You see, two people connected by that thread will stay good friends even if they're separated-nano.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:58.590
But if we can't see the thread,

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.600
we won't know we're connected.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:05.430
Hey, stop that! You really are connected-nano!

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:09.890
Mikan is connected with Aloma, so she understands-nano!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.320
Right, Aloma?

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:13.850
May you be cursed for all eternity!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:14.800
I've heard that one!

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.820
What she actually means is you'll always be good friends!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.780
Nano-nano!

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.000
That's it!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.520
My grandparents live here in Parajuku,

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:28.990
so I can come back for summer vacation and other holidays!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.280
And you can stay over at my house, too!

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.380
And we can walk Kero together!

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:35.160
Yeah!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.260
Even though we have to say bye-bye tomorrow,

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.960
we'll always be good friends!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.450
That's great!

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.930
You're smiling again!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.730
So, I have a Christmas present for you, Miruku-chan.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.930
Mum told me to give them to you.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.560
They're cute!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.900
I'll treasure them!

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:58.610
Their tears have turned into smiles-dearu!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:04:59.690
Capisce!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.180
Nano-dearu!

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:06.410
Cleaning up the place took longer than expected.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.050
You can say that again.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:11.370
We really should have been prepping for our Christmas concert today.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.950
Hey!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.310
Here come our rivals!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:16.130
Relax, Dorothy.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.170
It was a joke.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.920
Here's a Christmas present.

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:23.760
Please use them before today's concert.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.350
A glittering jellyfish energy item!

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:29.220
These are really rare!

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:33.180
I want everyone to have a good Christmas.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.740
But we'll be rivals for the WinDrea.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:39.500
Yep.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.290
Today's concert will be our breakup concert, won't it?

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.070
Only for the WinDrea.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.410
I'll be giving them to Lala and the others, too.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.340
It feels kind of weird thinking about it...

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:51.620
But exhilarating as well.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:52.870
Agreed.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.080
But it's all about Christmas today.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.620
I want to forget about all that and have fun today!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.040
We're in agreement.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.170
Tension ChrisMAX!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:01.740
Idiot!

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.750
Huh?

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.690
Idiot!

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.760
Don't call me an idiot, albatross!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.070
But that's a crow, Dorothy.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.980
You crooked crow!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.100
Give me back my energy item!

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.540
Hold it!

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.860
You keep one, Anko-chan!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:27.850
Huh?

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.320
It'll be our lucky item that shows we're always connected.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.500
You know how gloves only come in pairs, right?

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:38.040
So I want you to hold onto the left one!

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:41.270
Okay! Then it'll be a pair when we're together!

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:41.650
Someone catch that crooked crow!
Okay! Then it'll be a pair when we're together!

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:44.000
Someone catch that crooked crow!

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:45.250
Huh?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:45.960
Why you!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.920
Oh! It's a PriTicket!

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:51.580
Crows are mine demonic servants!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.960
So do as I say!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:58.180
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam...

00:06:58.710 --> 00:06:59.810
Idiot!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:00.520
Moron.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:05.270
Those who call me an idiot shall be punished!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.210
Give me back that glove!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.930
Way up there...?

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.000
What should we do?

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:29.470
Why would that crow take it when it's our lucky item?

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.920
Is that whole string of fate thing a lie?

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.130
Leave it to Mikan-nano!

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.810
She'll get it back in a jiffy-nano!

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:45.730
Eh?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.690
Gelrun!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.980
Mikan?
Mikan-chan?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:57.410
<i>I need to focus on obtaining...</i>

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:02.370
<i>...a fifth prodigy for the Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix.</i>

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:03.870
<i>However...</i>

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.180
<i>The only ones who come to mind are worthless.</i>

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.020
<i>Who the heck can I choose?</i>

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:22.350
Yes?

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:26.170
Mikan has something she'd like to ask the acting principal-nano.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.820
What should I do, Hibiki-sama?

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:32.890
Shiratama Mikan, the holder of an Autumn Coord?

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.630
She has one of the necessary coords...

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.600
Today's Christmas Eve, so if you're nice to someone,

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.410
I'm sure something good will happen.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.290
So let us in-nano!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.260
Let them in.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:51.960
And sorry for the intrusion-nano!

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.920
What are you planning to do?

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:55.560
Hibiki-sama,

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:59.120
does Shiratama Mikan's sentence ender "nano" not bother you?

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.270
Oh,

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:04.780
it's along the same lines as "desu" and "masu" which don't actually bother me.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:05.360
The others are beyond saving.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.490
Yes-daVinci!

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.400
Pri! Pri-pri!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:11.420
Going to go whizzing on this hang glider!

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:12.360
Huh?

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.720
Don't worry!

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:16.570
Mikan is properly licensed-nano!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.320
Ye may rest assured.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.390
Mikan may be a moron, but she's highly athletic.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:24.590
My family and I have watched her do it numerous times.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:25.540
I see.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:29.340
As this is the highest spot in Parajuku, this'll be a cinch-nano!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:33.010
Besides, a moron is said to be calm when at these heights-nano.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.070
Despite having the qualifications, she's still a primary schooler,

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.140
so it's too dangerous.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.260
No.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.510
Rather, it seems rather amusing;

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.820
this street flight.

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:41.970
Huh?

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:45.720
I'm also moderately interested in her abilities.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:46.390
Gel!

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.110
Please handle gathering the required flight clearance in all directions.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:49.740
But...

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:50.780
Fret not,

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.560
I'll be flying with her.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:58.380
Please take these radios with you just in case.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:09:59.780
Roger-nano!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:02.240
I'll be taking off first-nano!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.700
Gel-run!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:05.910
Hold on!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.160
How cheeky!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.380
The air feels great!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:18.090
High places are the best-nano!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.050
Hey, wait up!

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:24.230
There's often turbulence in urban areas with lots of buildings.

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:27.020
Instead of going straight, let's circle around from the west.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.480
Mikan doesn't know which direction is west,

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.810
but she's good at reading the wind-nano!

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.190
Gel-run!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.910
To be able to turn so easily in this turbulent air,

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:46.360
one must respond accordingly with intense force, judgement, and reflexes...

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:47.930
She's pretty good.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:56.920
Mikan-chan!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.040
It's right here!

00:10:58.040 --> 00:10:59.760
You can do it!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.760
Hey! Mikan-oneechan!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.720
Go for it!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.430
You can do it!

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.390
You're amazing!

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:08.510
Keep going!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.930
Gel-run!

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:27.620
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.550
Aloma-nano!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.220
The thread of fate!

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:47.310
Gel-run!

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:57.110
Gel-gel... Angel-run!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.780
It's good now-nano!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.780
Thank goodness!

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:03.610
See?

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.900
No matter how far apart we are,

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:09.020
Mikan is always connected to Aloma by the thread of fate-nano!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:14.960
Someone else is flying with her.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:26.390
We've finally arrived at the crow's nest-nano!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:28.760
<i>Good idea.</i>

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:33.220
<i>Having the fifth prodigy be an angel who can truly bring forth a miracle.</i>

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:36.310
<i>She could become my team's wildcard.</i>

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.980
Sorry-nano.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.480
Mikan will be returning these gloves-nano.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:43.160
You put yourself in danger just for that?

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.780
Of course-nano!

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:47.360
Here's a meat bun in exchange.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:49.240
Nom nom!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.940
Thanks-nano!

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:55.210
Mikan was able to get this glove because of you, Shikyouin-san-nano!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.390
You owe me one.

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:58.710
Owe?

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:00.730
Now I have something to ask of you.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:04.930
Will you perform with me at the Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix?

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.890
You want to join Alomagedon-nano?

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.850
No, I'm inviting just you.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:11.570
Huh?

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:15.490
If you're with me, you'll be able to further improve your skills.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:17.450
So how about it?

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:19.890
Mikan needs to talk to Aloma-nano!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:22.720
Anyway, time to hurry back-nano!

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:25.490
But Andou is coming to get us with a crane truck...

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:33.770
Eh?!

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:34.700
Santa-san?!

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:36.080
Hooray!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.260
Wah! It's Santa-san!

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:40.450
Nano?

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.110
Here!

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.060
Hooray!

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.850
Thanks, Onee-chan!

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:58.420
Miruku-chan, Anko-chan,

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:02.860
we'll put on the best Christmas concert as a present to you two today!

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:07.490
Both of you shall enjoy tonight's Christmas Deruderu Beam!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.540
We will!

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.410
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.620
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.500
Coord Change Start!

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:27.470
SoLaMi Dressing will be performing in the super popular White Christmas Coord.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.970
White Christmas Coord!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:31.470
Go!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.590
Yeah!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.810
Coord Change Start!

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:45.900
An arrangement of various decorations and fluffy fur make up this cute Santa-san Coord!

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:48.560
Christmas Santa Coord!

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:49.870
Devi!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.580
In addition to the wreath and star ornaments,

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:57.060
there's also the delicious looking cookie buttons, which are one of Mikan's favourite decorations.

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.860
White Christmas Santa Coord!

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:01.500
Gel-run!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:24.400
Cyalume Change!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:30.280
Pri!

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:30.850
Yeah!

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:31.420
Go!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.940
Making Drama Switch On!

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:38.870
Come forth, my demonic Christmas tree!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:44.450
Delivering Christmas presents to all the good boys and girls!

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:52.130
Alomagedon's Merry Christmas Present For You!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:56.090
Cyalume Change!

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.890
Gel-run!
Devi!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:23.580
Time to celebrate!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:27.540
Happy Merry Christmas!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.430
We became a team!

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.190
Amazing!

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:35.660
Awesome!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:36.720
Let's do our best!

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:39.300
They formed teams!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.180
Well, it is Christmas-pri.

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.220
Ah! It's shining-nano!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.810
Wait, Aloma's isn't, though.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:55.980
Oh yeah, the invitation to join Shikyouin-san's team-nano!

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:59.540
Aloma, what should Mikan do-nano?

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.140
It's just how things are done,

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.960
we must abide by the charm's decision.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:04.950
Eh?!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:08.630
Aloma Prophesy Grimoire, chapter 89,

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:12.170
"Angel's shall not defy holy nights!"-dealo!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.930
Got it-nano!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.730
Eh?!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:27.060
We've formed a team?

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:31.310
Tonight, the greatest Team Effort has been born-pri!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.560
We'll have a fair battle in the WinDrea!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.980
There are a lot of teams being formed today!

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:41.240
It must be a Christmas miracle!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:44.500
The hype for the upcoming WinDrea is bigger than ever!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.860
Miruku-chan!

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.250
Anko-chan!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.090
Bye-bye!

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:55.170
Have fun!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:00.010
Anko-chan, bye-bye!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.850
Bye-bye, Miruku-chan!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.090
Anko-chan...

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.410
Anko-chan's gone...

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:14.990
It's okay.

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:19.490
The two of ye are connected by the thread of fate-dealo.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.010
Yeah.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.030
Hey!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.030
Merry Christmas-nano!

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:17.640
The prodigy team has been born.

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:19.690
Let me tell you about its splendour.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.650
Our effort is stronger than your genius-pri!

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:24.380
Just watch us snatch the win out from under you-pri!

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:25.100
Next time:

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:25.950
Showdown!

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:28.060
The Winter GrandPrix Starts!

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:29.890
I'll show you my burning inner strength!
